      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O?Connell Auctioneers are delighted to present 28 The Elms, Mallow, Co. Cork to the market, a beautifully maintained and recently upgraded four-bedroom semi-detached family home situated in a mature and quiet cul-de-sac.\n\nExtending to approximately 1,275 sq. ft. (118.4 sq. m.), this impressive property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation and is presented in pristine condition throughout. The current owners have carried out a number of tasteful upgrades, creating a stylish and comfortable home that is ready for immediate occupation.\n\nThe ground floor has an excellent sense of space and natural light. To the front is a cosy separate sitting room, while to the rear lies the heart of the home ? a superb open-plan kitchen and living area overlooking the garden. Recently renovated, the kitchen features contemporary large-format floor tiling together with extensive fitted units across two walls, providing excellent storage and preparation space.\n\nThe adjoining living area is bright and inviting, with seamless access to the large, private rear garden, making this an ideal space for both everyday family life and entertaining. A separate utility room and convenient guest WC complete the ground-floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, there are four bedrooms together with the main family bathroom, which has also been recently renovated and finished to a high standard.\n\nExternally, the property has been designed with ease of maintenance in mind. To the front is a neat, low-maintenance garden area, while the enclosed rear garden provides a private outdoor space with the added benefit of side access.\n\nThe property enjoys an excellent location within walking distance of Mallow town centre and its wide range of shops, schools, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities. Mallow Train Station is also within walking distance, providing convenient access to the Cork?Dublin rail line and making the property particularly well suited to commuters.\n\nWith its spacious four-bedroom layout, recently upgraded interior, low-maintenance outdoor areas and highly convenient location, 28 The Elms represents an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking a turnkey family home in Mallow.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\nThe accommodation extends to approximately 1,275 sq. ft. (118.4 sq. m.) and comprises a sitting room, open-plan kitchen/living area, utility room, guest WC, four bedrooms and family bathroom.\n\nProperty Features\n\nFour-bedroom semi-detached family home\nApprox. 1,275 sq. ft. (118.4 sq. m.)\nPresented in pristine condition throughout\nRecently upgraded by the current owners\nBright and spacious open-plan kitchen/living accommodation\nSeparate sitting room\nUtility room and ground-floor guest WC\nPrivate, enclosed and low-maintenance rear garden\nSide access\nLow-maintenance front garden\nOil-fired central heating\nMature, quiet cul-de-sac setting\nWalking distance of Mallow town centre\nWalking distance of Mallow Train Station and the Cork?Dublin rail route"
      },
